# Decisions

Rulings that later work must respect, each with the alternatives rejected and the measurement
that decided it. This is a record, not a handbook. Append; never rewrite a past ruling — add
a new one that supersedes it and say so.

## Template

**Decision.** One sentence.
**Why.** The measurement or constraint.
**Rejected.** What else was considered and why not.
**Applies to.** Pages, batches or files.
